  "description": "The Cutthroat C Apex S1000 AXS Transmission is our adventure-ready drop-bar mountain bike designed to thrive in bikepacking events around the world. Cutthroat’s carbon fiber frame features our Class 5™ VRS (vibration reduction system) for comfort in the saddle on long-mile days. Our drop-bar mountain bike geometry puts you in a stable position for navigating more technical routes that include everything from gravel to singletrack. Pack all you need for your adventure with Cutthroat’s ample bag mounts and rack mounts. The SRAM Apex – S1000 AXS Transmission components ensure precise shifting and braking, and the 1 x 12 gearing gives you plenty of gear range for mountain passes or taking advantage of tailwinds.",
